The Chinese are gathering scrap in a last-ditch attempt to build a new Pegasus - if they succeed, we will be knocked straight back to square one. You will need to commandeer all the Chinese silos near you, to prevent them from gathering enough bio-metal. You will be issued with a standard Construction Rig to take control of the silos. Once all the Chinese supplies are under our control, you are to destroy their base.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Take control of all the Chinese scrap silos in your area.
- Destroy the Chinese base.
- Finish the silo capture within 45 minutes, and do not destroy any silo.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
Use the Construction Rig to take control of the silos - be careful with it, as it is slow, and has relatively light armor.